  "name": "Avocado Corn Salsa",
  "subtitle": "Bright, chilled salsa with creamy avocado",
  "description": "A colorful no-cook salsa combining sweet corn, olives, crisp vegetables, and a tangy herb dressing. Add the avocado after chilling to keep it fresh and distinct.",
